# Build context hygiene.
#
# Without this file the context is ~424 MB on a machine that has trained the
# model - the 271 MB corpus plus 131 MB of node_modules - all of which Docker
# uploads to its daemon on every build, for nothing. The image needs the source,
# the frontend package manifests, and the trained model. Nothing else.

# Training corpus - never needed in the image; the model ships pre-trained
data/

# Node modules are reinstalled inside the frontend build stage
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# Python bytecode and test caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# Local databases - the container uses its own volume at /data
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Version control and editor state
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/

# Scratch
*.zip
Smart India Hackathon.html
Smart India Hackathon_files/
